  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "apologize 是常考单词，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要知道：apologize to sb. 与 say sorry to sb. 意思相同，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：The boy "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "apologized to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " his friend because he had broken his glass."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= The boy "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "said sorry to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " his friend because he had broken his glass."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "这个男孩对他的朋友说“对不起”，因为他打碎了他的杯子。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
